{"title": "Australian Rock Singer Angry Anderson Dies at 79", "summary": "Gary 'Angry' Anderson, an Australian singer, songwriter, actor, and youth advocate, has died at the age of 79. He passed away following a cardiac arrest while on tour in Europe with his band, Rose Tattoo. Anderson had a career spanning 50 years in the music industry and was an inductee into the ARIA Hall of Fame.", "summary_points": [], "title_hi": "ऑस्ट्रेलियाई रॉक गायक एंग्री एंडरसन का 79 वर्ष की आयु में निधन", "summary_hi": "गैरी 'एंग्री' एंडरसन, एक ऑस्ट्रेलियाई गायक, गीतकार, अभिनेता और युवा अधिवक्ता, का 79 वर्ष की आयु में निधन हो गया है। यूरोप में अपने बैंड रोज़ टैटू के साथ दौरे के दौरान कार्डियक अरेस्ट के बाद उनका निधन हो गया। एंडरसन का संगीत उद्योग में 50 साल का करियर था और वे एआरआईए हॉल ऑफ फेम में शामिल थे।", "summary_points_hi": [], "framing": {"left": ["Highlights his role as a youth advocate in addition to his music career."], "center": ["Largely reported the events without a distinct frame."]}, "framing_hi": {"left": ["उनके संगीत करियर के अलावा एक युवा अधिवक्ता के रूप में उनकी भूमिका पर प्रकाश डालता है।"], "center": ["घटनाओं को काफी हद तक बिना किसी विशिष्ट फ्रेम के रिपोर्ट किया।"]}, "topic": "Society", "region": "World", "published_at": null, "image_url": "https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/c9c74b55d08f8522e0031f27f79c111b92fa3e83/444_0_4854_3882/master/4854.jpg?width=140&quality=85&auto=format&fit=max&s=f1f5ff7c17b801d3c3bbac05073d8ff2", "sources": [{"source": "The Guardian", "owner": "The Guardian", "lean": "left", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/music/2026/sep/23/angry-anderson-dies-rose-tattoo-frontman-death-aged-79", "headline": "Angry Anderson dies aged 79: Rose Tattoo frontman was a ferocious rock ’n’ roll singer and youth advocate"}, {"source": "ABC Australia", "owner": "ABC Australia", "lean": "center", "language": "en", "url": "https://www.abc.net.au/news/2026-09-23/angry-anderson-rose-tattoo-frontman-dies/107028898", "headline": "Australian rock legend A